    size: 5x5 bounding box; body occupies 4-15 pixels, marker occupies exactly 1 pixel, rest is background
    connectivity: may be disconnected (even 8-conn); no structural constraint
    grouping: each sprite belongs to exactly one marker group (1-3 sprites per marker)
    placement: no two sprites overlap; no sprite overlaps any corner 5x5 region; min gap >=1 cell
